    <Major>Albion online Market AUTOSELL</Major>
    <Description>                                                                       *MAJOR UPDATE*


* The progam now runs a 64ms delay it can auto sell faster than before and it can now buy in order at the same rate
                                selling and buyilng follow the same steps !
 
                                                ------ -- ALBION ONLINE MARKET AUTO SELL ------ -- 

Info: This macro can auto sell up to 100 items by activating it with a *hotkey* you can choose on your own.
There scripit runs __64MS__ intervals. Making it unrecognizable for any ANTI-CHEATS to detect it. meaning it makes the program run in incognito mode making it inpossible to get banned in game!

----
______

How to Use
                   _
1: Install the script
2; Assign the scripit on a HOTKEY!
3: Activate the program 
2; Have the market place open  IN GAME_
3; Open the selling tab 
4: Press the HOTKEY you chose


The scripit is programmed to sell order an  item and decrease one silver so you can get on the top of the selling list to sell  faster 

__Also
When all of the items have been sold press the HOTKEY you chose to de-activate the scripit.
After that you are ready to roam the opens

Have Fun!</Description>
